  - finance
  - machine learning
  - time series
abstract: >-
  End-to-end pipeline that turns daily DJIA headlines into FinBERT sentiment
  features, fuses them with technical indicators, and trains an XGBoost
  classifier to predict next-day up/down movement; includes reproducible code,
  backtest, and artifacts for demonstration.
